    '           / Extension can be used as a mask overlay        HIERARCH MP_TRANSIENT = 0 / Transient detected during SUR                       HIERARCH MP_OVERFLOW = 1 / Overflow detected during SUR                         HIERARCH MP_SUR_ERROR = 2 / Error in onboard processing                         HIERARCH MP_PHANTOM = 4 / Phantom pixel                                         HIERARCH MP_REFERENCE = 5 / Reference pixel                                     HIERARCH MP_NONFUNC = 6 / Permanently unusable                                  HIERARCH MP_DICHROIC = 7 / Low efficiency due to dichroic                       HIERARCH MP_MISSING_DATA = 9 / Onboard data lost                                MP_HOT  =                   10 / Hot pixel                                      MP_COLD =                   11 / Anomalously low signal                         HIERARCH MP_FULLSAMPLE = 12 / Pixel full sample history is available            HIERARCH MP_PHANMISS = 14 / Phantom correction was not applied                  HIERARCH MP_NONLINEAR = 15 / Nonlinearity correction cannot be applied reliably HIERARCH MP_PERSIST = 17 / Persistent charge above threshold                    HIERARCH MP_OUTLIER = 19 / Pixel flagged by Detect Outliers                     HIERARCH MP_SOURCE = 21 / Pixel mapped to a known source                        MP_GHOST=                   22 / Affected by a bright source inside the exposureHIERARCH MP_GHOST_FPA = 23 / Affected by a bright source on another detector    HIERARCH MP_GHOST_EXT = 24 / Pixel affected by a bright source outside FOV      MP_BLOOM=                   26 / Pixel part of a bloom artifact                 HIERARCH MP_SNOWBALL = 27 / Pixel part of a snowball artifact                   MP_HALO =                   28 / Pixel part of a transient halo                 EXTNAME = 'FLAGS   '           / extension name                                 WCSAXES =                    2 / Number of coordinate axes                      CRPIX1  =      